 [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn11le05ob01re2img03.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Let's get to it. As you are all aware we seem to have quite a few incidents with our guests as of late. As a result, there are some not so pleasant reviews floating around online. So today's staff meeting is a refresher on customer service. There's a lot we will touch base on. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>:  Fantastic! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: If everyone will take a seat, we can get started. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Michael</span>: It's like our first week of training all over again.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn11le05ob01re2img03.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Alright, so we all know that if we wait tables with efficiency, we maximize sales. However, we want to look at how we can maximize our sales over a longer period of time than just one visit. If the guests feel as welcome in the restaurant as they do in their own dining room, they're going to come back. So, how do we go about doing this? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Michael</span>: When we are on the restaurant floor, we smile. The restaurant is a stage and we are actors \u2026 so we should be smiling all the time! We will stand straight, not slouch, and smile! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It is important that everyone realizes that their primary job is connecting with the guests. When we've created an environment that makes every guest feel comfortable, the guest will want to come back to enjoy it again. More importantly, we need to eliminate guest complaints.", "id": 2, "time": "25000", "image": "engenn11le05ob01re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Michael</span>: The guests seem to love to complain \u2026 especially about Rachel, when she's walking around barefoot. If she would stop doing bizarre things, we wouldn't have any problems! Everything is always calmer when she's not here. She would be the one causing issues. It's so like her! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: I'm right here guys. Perhaps, if Mike keeps track of what we have in stock, we won't get any complaints. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: When you all settle down, we can start and we certainly don't have all day. So, let's stop throwing jabs at one another and get started.", "id": 3, "time": "74000", "image": "engenn11le05ob01re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le05ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le05ob01re2img03.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}